OL,3,GNEWSAEx-officer must repay #1.8m for
OL,4,Astolen Bitcoin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former National Crime Agency (NCA)
OL,7,Fofficer will have to repay #1.8m after
OL,8,Fstealing the valuable cryptocurrency
OL,9,FBitcoin he seized during an
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FPaul Chowles, 44, from Bristol, was
OL,13,Fjailed for five and a half years at
OL,14,FLiverpool Crown Court last year after
OL,15,Fpleading guilty to theft and money
OL,16,Flaundering.
OL,18,FAfter his part in an NCA investigation
OL,19,Finto criminals selling illegal goods on
OL,20,Fthe dark web, Chowles transferred about
OL,21,Fhalf of the Bitcoin seized from a drug
OL,22,Ftrafficker into his own accounts.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
